FROM --platform=$BUILDPLATFORM golang:1.27.1-alpine3.24@sha256:8a5910f31396cd4d89662f56c68b3ae31d374308270a1c3bd96672ee5ed43414 AS builder

ARG TARGETOS
ARG TARGETARCH

WORKDIR /src
ENV GOMAXPROCS=2

COPY go.mod go.sum ./
COPY cmd/mcp-oauth-facade ./cmd/mcp-oauth-facade
COPY internal/mcpoauth ./internal/mcpoauth

RUN CGO_ENABLED=0 GOOS=${TARGETOS:-linux} GOARCH=${TARGETARCH:-amd64} \
    go build -p=2 -mod=readonly -trimpath -buildvcs=false -ldflags="-s -w" \
    -o /out/mcp-oauth-facade ./cmd/mcp-oauth-facade

FROM alpine:3.24.2@sha256:294b683cb724975bec92580e1e685676bd4b50bda910ddb8c51d4cabeaec77e6

RUN apk add --no-cache ca-certificates \
    && addgroup -S -g 65532 geul \
    && adduser -S -D -H -u 65532 -G geul geul

COPY --from=builder /out/mcp-oauth-facade /usr/local/bin/mcp-oauth-facade

USER 65532:65532
EXPOSE 8080

ENTRYPOINT ["/usr/local/bin/mcp-oauth-facade"]
